{"id":"6aa263dfdfa0a2e41f558c0c4c7ea905d998a952","axis":"silent","repo":"astral-sh/uv","sha":"6aa263dfdfa0a2e41f558c0c4c7ea905d998a952","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -9,6 +9,19 @@ Unreleased."," "," ### Breaking changes"," ","+- **Omit the distutils startup patch on Python 3.10 and later**","+  ([#22096](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22096))","+","+  Previously, uv installed `_virtualenv.py` and `_virtualenv.pth` into every new virtual environment","+  to prevent distutils configuration from changing installation paths. Now, uv omits these files on","+  Python 3.10 and later, which already ignore the affected configuration keys. This reduces Python","+  startup overhead. Python 3.9 and earlier retain the patch.","+","+  You cannot opt out of this behavior. Existing virtual environments are not modified automatically.","+  Recreate an environment with Python 3.10 or later to remove the patch.","+","+  This stabilizes the `no-distutils-patch` preview feature.","+"," ## 0.12.x"," "," See [changelogs/0.12.x](./changelogs/0.12.x.md)"],"additions":13,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Cargo.lock","lines":["@@ -8297,7 +8297,6 @@ dependencies = [","  \"uv-errors\",","  \"uv-fs\",","  \"uv-platform-tags\",","- \"uv-preview\",","  \"uv-pypi-types\",","  \"uv-python-interpreter\",","  \"uv-python-managed\","],"additions":0,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/uv-dev/src/generate_preview_features_reference.rs","lines":["@@ -145,8 +145,6 @@ mod tests {","         - <a id=\"missing-exclude-newer-package-lock\" href=\"#missing-exclude-newer-package-lock\"><code>missing-exclude-newer-package-lock</code></a>: Exclude `exclude-newer-package` entries from the lockfile when not included in the","           project's resolved dependencies.","         - <a id=\"native-auth\" href=\"#native-auth\"><code>native-auth</code></a>: Enables storage of credentials in a [system-native location](../concepts/authentication/http.md#the-uv-credential